1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Postio — schedule and publish videos to TikTok
together with other networks.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Sign in to Postio with email or Google.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:40,000
This account is pre-authorized for the TikTok
sandbox (BETA reviewer access).

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Open Accounts → find the TikTok card → Connect
→ confirm in the dialog.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:05,000
TikTok's consent screen asks for profile info
(user.info.basic), posting (video.publish) and
draft upload (video.upload).

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Grant access and return to the app.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The OAuth exchange (PKCE + code) is handled
server-side; the token is kept server-side
and refreshed automatically.

8
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Posts → New Post. Add a title.

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Append a short .mp4 video file.

10
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Select the connected TikTok account.

11
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Video is uploaded to Postio storage first;
TikTok receives it via the Content Posting API
at publish time.

12
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:13,000
The visibility dropdown follows the creator's
privacy_level_options; nothing is pre-selected.

13
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:19,000
The user picks Only me
(Followers, Friends, Only me are offered).

14
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Interactions: Allow comments unticked; Duet and
Stitch are unavailable for this account.

15
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Commercial content disclosure is off by default.

16
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:41,000
The user turns it on and selects "Promoting
myself/my business" (Brand Organic).

17
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Music Usage Confirmation is ticked
before publishing.

18
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Click Publish Now (Time and publish section).

19
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:15,000
The server runs the Content Posting sequence:
creator_info/query → video/init → upload → status/fetch.

20
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Redirect to Posts → toast "Your post was published
successfully".

21
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:35,000
The post card shows the Published badge — only
after TikTok reports PUBLISH_COMPLETE.

22
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Open the published post in the edit dialog.

23
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:50,000
The edit dialog states: TikTok does not support
editing or deleting posts after publishing.

24
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Preview → View on network opens the connected
account on tiktok.com.

25
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:15,000
On tiktok.com: Profile → Videos. The video
shows a lock icon, the "Private" label and
"Promotional content" (Brand Organic).

26
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:23,000
The delete dialog notes that TikTok doesn't
allow deleting videos through its API, so the
video must be removed manually.

27
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Confirming archives the post in Postio; the
user then removes the video manually on TikTok.

28
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:40,000
The post stays in Postio history, marked
Archived, with a greyed-out TikTok icon.

29
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Thank you for reviewing Postio.
Questions: hello@postio-app.cz